    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the shell just rest\"... what does that even mean? ugh. i feel like i'm just haunting my own life. it's like i'm a ghost. if the person people loved and followed is literally gone, and all that's left is this... this nothingness... what's even the point of trying to build something new? everything is just empty.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
